<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35421" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		later form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>active, effective,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανὰς ἐνεργεῖς ποιοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.44
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of medicines, <i>strong,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1088.56
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.88
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>
			<i>more effective,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					105a19
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατος, πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				291.9
			</span></i>.</div>
